"Bye, Mom!"
"Bye, Dad!" I say.
"See you soon, Maya!" says my family.
I close the laptop.
It is quiet in the flat.
I am a little homesick.
I need fresh air.
I put on my jacket and go outside.
It is January and very cold.
My street is very quiet today.
It is Sunday.
The supermarket is closed.
The clothes shop is also closed.
Only the Späti on the corner is still open.
Who is here on the street?
Almost nobody.
I walk a bit and think about home.
My father, my mother, my brother and my sister.
That was a great conversation.
Then I go back upstairs.
